#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:5 cf260017df1d4ce2bd0f761246102fd4
msgid "OSD based parameter menu"
msgstr "基于 OSD 的参数菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:7 f08536dce42640e1a30cb46e2d7ac5ab
msgid ""
"This allows to set and adjust parameters using the ArduPilot onboard OSD and"
" an RC transmitter's stick input. There's two additional OSD screens "
"available (OSD5 and OSD6), with 9 \"slots\" each to hold parameters. The "
"screens display a default set of parameters to start with. Additionally, it "
"is possible to change the parameter used in a respective slot directly (on-"
"screen) using stick inputs, or using MAVProxy's osd-module command-line "
"setup."
msgstr ""
"这允许使用 ArduPilot 机载 OSD 和遥控器摇杆输入来设置和调整参数。提供了两个额外的 OSD 屏幕（OSD5 和 OSD6），每个屏幕有 9"
" 个「槽位」用于存放参数。屏幕默认显示一组默认参数。此外，可以直接在屏幕上通过摇杆输入更改相应槽位的参数，也可使用 MAVProxy 的 osd "
"模块命令行进行设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:12 d82e6b9c9c4949dfa908db79fdcd4b95
msgid ""
"OpenTX/EdgeTX CRSF lua scripts allow access to this feature in some radio "
"transmitters."
msgstr "OpenTX/EdgeTX CRSF lua 脚本允许在某些遥控器上访问此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:15 50c8c0b573e24a8fb6e1bba91c01c748
msgid "Copter default screens:"
msgstr "Copter 默认屏幕："

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:24 c120906b478a4c39a69b7a1d7f7ee475
msgid "Plane default screens:"
msgstr "Plane 默认屏幕："

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:31 ba305d6e434d4abba969ecbc01d399c8
msgid ""
"The RC transmitter's roll and pitch stick input is used to navigate through "
"the screen, pick a parameter and adjust the parameter value. Parameter "
"values can be adjusted in disarmed state only."
msgstr "遥控器的横滚和俯仰摇杆输入用于在屏幕中导航、选择参数并调整参数值。仅在上锁状态下才能调整参数值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:34 aab9bf776dfc45999b011ff2004ab776
msgid ""
"Additionally there's a \"save and reboot\" button on each screen that allows"
" to save the adjusted settings and reboot the flightcontroller if required. "
"It defaults to \"reboot\", will auto-switch to \"save\" if a parameter value"
" has been altered, and switch back to \"reboot\" after saving is completed."
msgstr ""
"此外，每个屏幕都有一个「save and "
"reboot」按钮，允许保存调整后的设置并在需要时重启飞控。默认为「reboot」，如果参数值已更改则自动切换为「save」，保存完成后切换回「reboot」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:40 13228975c8d44a389aaa04d80dc4dc4e
msgid ""
"Using the \"save\" button after adjusting a parameter will make the "
"adjustments persistent, otherwise the value will be reset to its prior state"
" after a reboot."
msgstr "调整参数后使用「save」按钮将使调整永久生效，否则重启后值将恢复到之前的状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:43 bbbc771c3a80460083c2fd566eb37b0e
msgid "Accessing parameter screens"
msgstr "访问参数屏幕"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:45 7c43e5c20051479896402a3cd1fb0ecb
msgid ""
"To enable the parameter screens, set :ref:`OSD5_ENABLE <OSD5_ENABLE>` and "
":ref:`OSD6_ENABLE <OSD6_ENABLE>` = 1. Parameter screens can be accessed in "
"the same way the conventional osd screens are accessed. See the "
"documentation on :ref:`OSD screens and switching <screen-switching>` for "
"reference. When one of the parameter screens is selected, adjustments can be"
" made in disarmed state only. If a parameter screen is selected inflight, "
"the screen allows display only. This allows live monitoring of automatic "
"parameter adjustments, i.e. when performing autotune procedures or automatic"
" servo trims."
msgstr ""
"要启用参数屏幕，将 :ref:`OSD5_ENABLE <OSD5_ENABLE>` 和 :ref:`OSD6_ENABLE "
"<OSD6_ENABLE>` 设置为 1。参数屏幕的访问方式与传统 OSD 屏幕相同。参考 :ref:`OSD 屏幕与切换 <screen-"
"switching>` "
"文档。选择参数屏幕后，仅在上锁状态下可进行调整。如果在飞行中选择了参数屏幕，则屏幕仅允许显示。这使得可以实时监控自动参数调整，例如在执行 "
"AutoTune 程序或自动舵机微调时。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:52 df8c1ceb65ca473c81084e1e15f54f05
msgid ""
"For systems not using an actual OSD, as when using CRSF with no OSD or DJI "
"OSD, and running OpenTX transmitters with CRSF configuration script, setting"
" :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` =3 (MSP), will allow the OpenTX CRSF script on "
"the transmitter to change these parameters."
msgstr ""
"对于不使用实际 OSD 的系统（如使用无 OSD 的 CRSF 或 DJI OSD，并运行带 CRSF 配置脚本的 OpenTX 遥控器），将 "
":ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 设置为 3（MSP），将允许遥控器上的 OpenTX CRSF 脚本更改这些参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:55 9e69b2de3916415f8d5318b1d8f1efcc
msgid "Menu navigation"
msgstr "菜单导航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:57 63cef8f22c6e43cfb0fd35c573e6cc37
msgid ""
"Use the RC transmitter's roll and pitch input to navigate through the "
"parameter screen. UP / DOWN and LEFT / RIGHT will navigate through the "
"screen's parameter slots. The selected parameter will blink. Move right on "
"the selected parameter to adjust its value using up or down stick input. "
"Leave the selection with left roll stick input. On a typical mode 2 type "
"transmitter this would be the right gimbal stick:"
msgstr ""
"使用遥控器的横滚和俯仰输入在参数屏幕中导航。上/下和左/右将在屏幕的参数槽位间移动。选中的参数将闪烁。将摇杆向右移动到选中的参数，然后通过上下摇杆输入调整其值。向左移动横滚摇杆退出选择。在典型的"
" Mode 2 遥控器上，这将是右摇杆："

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:68 01ebcd76ea9847908586c28c5b4e2bc0
msgid "Parameter slot scroll-selection"
msgstr "参数槽位滚动选择"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:70 a3602b2480ab4da98d953293cb3928af
msgid ""
"Holding roll right for > 3 seconds on a parameter's value will highlight "
"both the selected parameter and its value (blink). This allows you to scroll"
" through the full list of parameters and place another parameter into that "
"respective slot using pitch up and down stick input. Move left to exit "
"parameter selection and get back into standard screen navigation."
msgstr ""
"在参数值上向右持续拨杆超过 3 "
"秒，将同时高亮显示所选参数及其值（闪烁）。这允许您通过俯仰上下摇杆输入滚动浏览完整参数列表，并将另一个参数放入该槽位。向左移动以退出参数选择并返回标准屏幕导航。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:76 a7a650214f654ef6aec0b73ac37da828
msgid ""
"OSD based parameter adjustment is designed to allow basic adjustments "
"without any additional data link or GCS setup required. However, some "
"parameters with exceptionally wide value ranges, as well as complex bitmap-"
"type parameters might not be ideal for adjustment using parameter OSD."
msgstr ""
"基于 OSD 的参数调整旨在无需任何额外数据链路或地面站设置即可进行基本调整。但是，某些具有极宽数值范围的参数以及复杂的位图类型参数可能不适合通过 "
"OSD 参数进行调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:81 fb514c6d5fca4d5a9a5aa87c545a9306
msgid "Parameter range, increment and type-mnemonics"
msgstr "参数范围、步进量和类型助记符"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:83 139f655062814220b40815fdc466afbb
msgid ""
"OSD based parameter menu uses parameter metadata to estimate a useful value "
"range and incrementation for each parameter. Additionally, support for the "
"display of human-readable abbreviations instead of numeric values is "
"provided for the following parameter types:"
msgstr "基于 OSD 的参数菜单使用参数元数据来估算每个参数的有用数值范围和步进量。此外，还为以下参数类型提供了显示可读缩写而非数字值的支持："

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:86 0a91ddea383c4940ba74f7835af493e0
msgid "flightmodes"
msgstr "飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:88 02b7c853630d44159a6894668c5269d9
msgid "servo functions"
msgstr "舵机功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:90 8939fd3ca2124a288dd036bf79020c7d
msgid "serial protocols"
msgstr "串口协议"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:92 e4b8e3d1f4d8457b9f15bd291af55c31
msgid "RC aux options"
msgstr "RC 辅助选项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:94 806e6ab38edb48fea4f619a2a013f6db
msgid "failsafe actions"
msgstr "失控保护动作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:98 900b8e5396994c95833c84e180c51bf6
msgid ""
"This feature may have limitations on certain parameters with exceptionally "
"wide value ranges and when handling bitmap-type parameters."
msgstr "此功能对某些具有极宽数值范围的参数以及处理位图类型参数时可能有限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:103 0a9cc51087b948a5916df3c9cb993492
msgid "Populating a screen's parameter slots using MAVProxy's OSD module"
msgstr "使用 MAVProxy OSD 模块填充屏幕参数槽位"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:105 df12ca0261dd479f9abe694dbc33a1b4
msgid ""
"OSD based parameter setting includes a `MAVProxy module "
"<https://ardupilot.org/mavproxy/>`__ to populate each screen's parameter "
"slots. Connect your autopilot, connect tp MAVProxy and load the OSD module "
"by typing :code:`module load osd`"
msgstr ""
"基于 OSD 的参数设置包含一个 `MAVProxy 模块 <https://ardupilot.org/mavproxy/>`__ "
"用于填充每个屏幕的参数槽位。连接飞控，连接到 MAVProxy 并通过输入 :code:`module load osd` 加载 OSD 模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:110 f8b8e7a7e9634afca8c85e9e87e3cfa0
msgid ""
"The osd module is supported by MAVProxy 1.8.21 and later. Type :code:`pip "
"install --upgrade pymavlink MAVProxy --user` to update MAVProxy if required."
msgstr ""
"osd 模块由 MAVProxy 1.8.21 及更高版本支持。如需更新 MAVProxy，请输入 :code:`pip install "
"--upgrade pymavlink MAVProxy --user`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:114 7a2a1c01d7a442458cd16eb121a4c3f2
msgid ""
