#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:146 b8528e42056a48f3bc760c6a73d06318
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:148 889db998ea444b1493ac5d8678ef6f3d
msgid ""
"To set OSD5 parameter1 to TRIM_THROTTLE, type :code:`osd param-show 5 1 "
"TRIM_THROTTLE`"
msgstr ""
"要将 OSD5 参数 1 设置为 TRIM_THROTTLE，输入 :code:`osd param-show 5 1 TRIM_THROTTLE`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:150 6844e0b24b8949a2889d1ccceb82e3bd
msgid ""
"To set OSD6 parameter2 to FLTMODE1 using respective mnemonics, type "
":code:`osd param-set 6 2 FLTMODE1 FLIGHT_MODE`"
msgstr ""
"要使用相应助记符将 OSD6 参数 2 设置为 FLTMODE1，输入 :code:`osd param-set 6 2 FLTMODE1 "
"FLIGHT_MODE`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:152 6ac3867034a749fb8a8375b52fbaad8f
msgid ""
"To set OSD5 parameter2 to LIM_ROLL_CD, limiting range from 2000 - 6000 with "
"increments of 100, type :code:`osd param-set 5 2 LIM_ROLL_CD 2000 6000 100`"
msgstr ""
"要将 OSD5 参数 2 设置为 LIM_ROLL_CD，限制范围为 2000 - 6000，步进量为 100，输入 :code:`osd param-"
"set 5 2 LIM_ROLL_CD 2000 6000 100`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:154 5f780b15c92645e18089836242dca055
msgid ""
"To show what OSD6 parameter2 is set to, type :code:`osd param-show 6 2`"
msgstr "要查看 OSD6 参数 2 的设置，输入 :code:`osd param-show 6 2`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-paramosd.rst:159 f509208e81c44fd8900307fbe9e7f8b9
msgid ""
"Be aware that some :code:`TYPE` mnemonic options are vehicle-specific. Make "
"sure to apply mnemonics to the correct vehicle type in order to avoid "
"unexpected results"
msgstr "请注意，某些 :code:`TYPE` 助记符选项是飞行器特定的。请确保将助记符应用于正确的飞行器类型以避免意外结果"
